Subject: [PATCH 18/18] chore(desktop): version 1.3.0

1.3.0 bundles the in-sample station rows of the 167 training stations
(212 stations in the Stations tab) next to the unchanged 45-station
held-out benchmark, and adds the detection-policy plumbing the ISO 15118
edition uses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
